  "description": "MCP server for finding local food producers in Norway. Search 1,380+ farms, markets, and shops across 380+ cities. Get contact info, opening hours, products, and vCard links.\n\n**Features:**\n- Natural language search in Norwegian and English\n- Filter by category: vegetables, fruit, dairy, eggs, meat, fish, bread, honey\n- Location-based discovery across all of Norway\n- vCard contact links for every producer\n- Trust scores based on data completeness\n\n**Example queries:**\n- \"Hvor finner jeg fersk honning i Oslo?\"\n- \"organic vegetables near Bergen\"\n- \"gårdsbutikker i Lofoten\"",
